Z||000000||ArmandoP||11-29-2000||11:12 PM||||hey fieroites,<BR>just want to extend an official invitation to you all to join us MR2 people at Gingerman raceway this summer.  The illianamoc (illiana Mr2 Owners Club) is hosting a track day and general meet at gingerman.  exact date is yet to be set.  youare all invited.  we need a total of 40 people wanting to run their cars and other s are welcome to come and watch and join in on BBQ and such. prizes will be given by sponsors (speedshops, mostly.  To run it i $150 for the day.  this includes insurance and such.  If you want to go andf just watch and hang out, have fun there is a registration fee, but that wont be very much, just enough to help cover some of the costs of hosting this event.<P>also, if the fiero club is interested in attractying a couple of sponsors to this event who would be willing to give away prizes in exchange for the exposure and letting them set up a booth and give out catalogs, the more sponsors the merrier.  ID like to offer free prizes that are relevant to the car each person drives. (what good would a free set of cross drilled rotors for an MR2 do for a fiero owner???? nothing right?)<BR>anyways, feel free to email me at ajperez@indiana.edu<BR>or AIM at mandosax<BR>roght now the only cars being excluded are vipers, and only because it would triple our insurance rate for the event.<BR>Armando<P>------------------<BR>__________________<BR>will work for MR2 parts!!! <BR>1987 MR2 NA t-bar csp with 700 miles on its new engine. <BR>TRD copper head gasket, milled head .020, 2 short shifters,metal masters rear brake pads, 195-60-14 (soon to get new tires), clear corners, Clevite 77 bearings, NO A/C, MAF relocation mod, red silicon vacuum hoses, redline tranny fluid,and the stock exhaust with a WHOLE bunch of broken welds! <BR>indiana/illinois MR2 owners club<BR>[URL]http://php.indiana.edu/~ajperez/inimoc.html [/URL]<BR>[IMG] <A HREF="http://php.indiana.edu/~ajperez/4age.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://php.indiana.edu/~ajperez/4age.jpg</A>  [/IMG]||||reg||14
Z||000001||Seanh||11-29-2000||11:20 PM|||| <A HREF="http://php.indiana.edu/~ajperez/inimoc.html" TARGET=_blank>http://php.indiana.edu/~ajperez/inimoc.html</A> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://php.indiana.edu/~ajperez/4age.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> no spaces between your [img] tag and the begining of the address or the end.<P>What is the general idea for a date? I know you dont a date set yet, but I am just wondering what the time of year, ballpark idea, of a date will be. Thanks for the Invite.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
